# Code owners for BareD.
#
# Owners are requested for review automatically when a PR touches their paths.
# Later, more specific rules win over earlier ones.
#
# BareD currently has a single maintainer, so the catch-all covers everything.
# The explicit entries below exist to make the sensitive areas visible rather
# than to route work elsewhere — split them out when there are more maintainers.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                               @etowett

# Security-sensitive: credential handling, encryption, auth, storage paths.
/SECURITY.md                    @etowett
/apps/api/internal/encryption/  @etowett
/apps/api/internal/storage/     @etowett
/apps/api/internal/api/         @etowett
/apps/api/internal/config/      @etowett

# Supply chain and release: CI, container build, release automation, agent config.
/.github/                       @etowett
/.goreleaser.yml                @etowett
/Dockerfile                     @etowett
/compose.yml                    @etowett
/.claude/                       @etowett
/.codex/                        @etowett

# Project governance.
/LICENSE                        @etowett
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @etowett
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @etowett
